### SearchVisitors
# @name searchVisitors
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/visitors?page=1&pageSize=20
X-User-Id: {{receptionUserId}}

### CreateVisitor
# @name createVisitor
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/visitors
X-User-Id: {{receptionUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Rahul Khanna",
  "organization": "Infosys Ltd",
  "contactReference": "+91-98450-00000",
  "visitPurpose": "Vendor meeting",
