### GetRolePermissions
# @name getRolePermissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/roles/{{roleId}}/permissions
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### SetRolePermissions - Replaces the role's grant list; the sample re-applies the grants read by GetRolePermissions (idempotent).
# @name setRolePermissions
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/admin/roles/{{roleId}}/permissions
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissionIds": {{grantedPermissionIds}}
}

